Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Second way (which should be manifestly wrong: I truncate \[Tau] to first \
order in (q - q0), but then I expand it to first order in q ti match the rhs. \
This should be wrong because there are infinite contributions from the first \
order in q of (q - q0)^n. However I get the same result...)\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9901590271966953`*^9, 3.9901590532082233`*^9}, {
